肥嘟嘟桌宠 · FeiDuDu Desktop Pet
================================

这个项目分两部分授权 / This project is licensed in two parts:

1. 代码 / Code — MIT License (below)
   feidudu.pyw、feidudu_pet/ 里的所有文件、art-source/lib_pet.js（蜡笔画笔）、art-source/runpet.py
   feidudu.pyw, everything in feidudu_pet/, art-source/lib_pet.js (the crayon renderer), art-source/runpet.py

2. 肥嘟嘟的形象和画 / FeiDuDu's character and artwork — CC BY-NC 4.0, see LICENSE-ART.md
   sprites/、docs/、feidudu_icon.ico，以及 art-source/ 里其余的文件（肥嘟嘟、饰品、叶子、输入法皮肤、菜单的画法）
   sprites/, docs/, feidudu_icon.ico, and the rest of art-source/ (how FeiDuDu, accessories, leaves, the IME skin and menus are drawn)

泡泡里的字体龙藏体 Long Cang 不在仓库里（画帧时自动下载），它用的是 SIL Open Font License。
The Long Cang font used in speech bubbles is not included (it is downloaded when rendering) and is under the SIL Open Font License.

